{"id":"C1-L021","title":"Hardly / scarcely — practice and contrast","cefr":"C1","level":"C1","unit":"C1-U02","focus":"Hardly / scarcely — prática e contraste","targets":{"grammar":"Hardly / scarcely — prática e contraste","pron":"Expressividade","verbs":["challenge"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["tight brief","client reply","intern workload","office banter","sleepless night","last-minute change","urgent request","rapid turnaround","manager expectation","report draft","late-night work","coffee refill","stress joke","scheduling clash","overtime hours","task handoff","email ping","approval delay","revision round","project crunch","dry humor","comic timing"],"field":"Negócios","genre":"Charge, tirinha e cartum","skill":"Fala","words_min":22},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 21 · Hardly / scarcely — practice and contrast","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Hardly / scarcely — prática e contraste.","**Verbos:** challenge.","**Pronúncia:** Expressividade.","**22 palavras novas** (negócios).","**Texto do dia:** charge, tirinha e cartum."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (C1):** eu consigo contrastar hardly/scarcely/barely (advérbios) com as estruturas invertidas, e usar challenge numa tirinha."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["tight brief","briefing apertado"],["client reply","resposta do cliente"],["intern workload","carga do estagiário"],["office banter","conversa de escritório"],["sleepless night","noite sem dormir"],["last-minute change","mudança de última hora"],["urgent request","pedido urgente"],["rapid turnaround","entrega rápida"],["manager expectation","expectativa do gerente"],["report draft","rascunho de relatório"],["late-night work","trabalho noturno"],["coffee refill","reposição de café"],["stress joke","piada sobre estresse"],["scheduling clash","conflito de agenda"],["overtime hours","horas extras"],["task handoff","passagem de tarefa"],["email ping","aviso de e-mail"],["approval delay","atraso de aprovação"],["revision round","rodada de revisão"],["project crunch","aperto de projeto"],["dry humor","humor seco"],["comic timing","timing cômico"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A cartoon strip","blocks":[{"type":"comic","title":"Deadline Day","panels":[{"scene":"⏰","bubbles":[["Boss","Hardly had I given the brief when you finished?"],["Intern","Barely. I could hardly sleep."]],"cap":"Panel 1"},{"scene":"💻","bubbles":[["Boss","Scarcely had you sent it when the client replied."],["Intern","No sooner had I relaxed than it came back."]],"cap":"Panel 2"},{"scene":"☕","bubbles":[["Boss","You really challenge my expectations."],["Intern","Hardly anyone challenges your deadlines, sir."]],"cap":"Panel 3"}],"gloss":[["brief","briefing"],["reply","responder"],["expectation","expectativa"],["deadline","prazo"]],"say":""}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The intern finished the brief almost at once.","ans":"T","why":"Hardly had I given."},{"q":"The client replied before the document was sent.","ans":"F","why":"Scarcely had you sent it when."},{"q":"The intern says many people challenge the deadlines.","ans":"F","why":"Hardly anyone."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“barely” = ?","opts":["mal, por pouco","nu","barriga"],"ans":0,"why":"Barely."},{"q":"“challenge” (verb) = ?","opts":["desafiar, questionar","chance","cancelar"],"ans":0,"why":"challenge my expectations."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"hardly / scarcely / barely — contraste","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Forma","Sentido","Exemplo"],"rows":[["hardly / scarcely / barely (advérbio)","quase não","